      "_id": "adeptusActor20It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>While the Arco-Flagellant is in Passive Mode, it is considered to be blind. It cannot sense and interact with the world for the most part, and is immune to the Blinded condition. It will remain in Passive mode until given a specific code word or phrase, which can be spoken, transmitted via vox, or sent psychically through Telepathy.  Active Mode: While the Arco-Flagellant is in Active Mode, it is considered to be Frenzied (page 111 CRB), and can now \"see\" objects and people out to a range of Medium Range, ignoring darkness and all but the densest of obstruction.</p>"
        },
